01:31:06.720 --> 01:31:08.800
[Man]Bravo!

01:31:13.160 --> 01:31:15.600
[Phone Ringing]

01:31:15.640 --> 01:31:18.080
Maxine?

01:31:18.120 --> 01:31:21.520
