01:31:35.520 --> 01:31:37.680
Hello? Hello?

01:31:37.760 --> 01:31:40.120
- [ Lester ] We have Maxine.
- Oh! My God.

01:31:40.240 --> 01:31:42.400
Please, please,
don't hurt her.

01:31:42.480 --> 01:31:45.680
Listen, I'll-- I'll give you
anything you want. Please.

01:31:45.760 --> 01:31:48.560
You listen to me, asshole.
I don't want your fucking money.

01:31:48.680 --> 01:31:52.240
What I want is for you
to leave John Malkovich now!

01:31:52.360 --> 01:31:55.240
- Who-- Who is this, Lester?
- Does it matter?

01:31:55.360 --> 01:31:58.480
We're gonna kill Maxine
if you don't leave the body immediately!

01:31:58.520 --> 01:32:00.880
But l-l-l can't do that.

01:32:00.920 --> 01:32:04.680
I mean, if-if I leave Malkovich,
then I'm Craig Schwartz again.

01:32:04.760 --> 01:32:07.600
No career, no money.
Maxine will have nothing to do--

01:32:07.640 --> 01:32:09.920
She barely has anything
to do with me now.

01:32:10.000 --> 01:32:13.800
Jesus, we're going to kill your wife,
you fucking lunatic!

01:32:13.880 --> 01:32:15.760
[ Moans ] God.

01:32:15.840 --> 01:32:18.880
Listen, Schwartz,
Malkovich is our vessel. We're old.

01:32:18.920 --> 01:32:21.920
We're going to die
if we don't get into him by midni--

01:32:30.800 --> 01:32:33.200
[Dial Tone Buzzing]

01:32:36.880 --> 01:32:40.360
- He called our bluff.
- [People Gasping]

01:32:40.440 --> 01:32:42.640
Shit!

01:32:42.720 --> 01:32:45.960
Can't we just go inside the portal
and push Craig out?

01:32:46.000 --> 01:32:47.880
No, he's much too powerful.

01:32:47.920 --> 01:32:52.000
Schwartz would just jam us down
into Malkovich's subconscious.

01:33:14.680 --> 01:33:16.760
Lotte.

01:33:18.840 --> 01:33:22.040
If I can't have you, no one will.

01:33:22.080 --> 01:33:24.680
[Gun Cocks]

01:33:24.760 --> 01:33:27.440
-[Lester]Lotte, no!
-[Gunshot]

01:33:27.520 --> 01:33:30.400
No, Lotte!
God, no, we can't really kill her!

01:33:30.440 --> 01:33:34.200
She's carrying Malkovich's seed!
Our next vessel!

01:33:35.480 --> 01:33:37.360
[ Grunts, Shouts ]

01:33:41.400 --> 01:33:43.760
Hey! Help me!

01:33:44.880 --> 01:33:47.240
Help me!

01:33:47.320 --> 01:33:50.480
- Where the fuck am l?
- We 're in Malkovich's subconscious.

01:33:50.560 --> 01:33:53.720
The last thing
you'll ever see, Maxine.

01:33:53.800 --> 01:33:55.960
- [Gunshot]
- [ Glass Shattering ]

01:33:56.040 --> 01:33:58.000
Fag-o-vitch!

01:33:58.080 --> 01:33:59.720
[Man]
Johnny, baby, Johnny.

01:34:04.320 --> 01:34:06.840
[Boy]
Bad. I am bad. I am bad.

01:34:06.920 --> 01:34:11.120
-I am bad. I am bad. I am bad. I am bad.
-[ Groaning ]

01:34:11.160 --> 01:34:13.520
I am bad. I am bad.
I am bad.

01:34:13.560 --> 01:34:15.960
- I am bad. I am bad.
-[Door Crashes Open]

01:34:16.080 --> 01:34:18.400
I am bad.
I am bad. I am bad.

01:34:29.040 --> 01:34:32.600
Maxine, lam gonna kill you!

01:34:35.400 --> 01:34:37.240
You're creepy.

01:34:45.600 --> 01:34:49.440
[ Kids Chanting ]
Little Johnny Malk-o-pee!

01:34:49.520 --> 01:34:52.680
Little Johnny Malk-o-pee!

01:34:52.720 --> 01:34:55.520
Wet his pants so all could see!

01:34:55.560 --> 01:34:57.480
Little Johnny Malk-o-pee!

01:34:57.560 --> 01:35:00.800
Little Johnny Malk-o-pee!

01:35:00.840 --> 01:35:03.240
Wet his pants so all could see!

01:35:03.320 --> 01:35:05.760
[ Both Grunting ]

01:35:16.200 --> 01:35:19.240
- I loved you so much!
- [Cars Passing]

01:35:20.440 --> 01:35:23.800
Oh! Why did you have
to hurt me like that?

01:35:23.920 --> 01:35:25.760
I'm sorry, Lotte.

01:35:25.840 --> 01:35:29.600
I guess I loved you, too, in my way.

01:35:29.680 --> 01:35:34.120
You are so full of shit, Maxine!

01:35:34.200 --> 01:35:36.600
I know.

01:35:36.640 --> 01:35:38.520
I know!

01:35:42.160 --> 01:35:44.320
It's your baby, okay?

01:35:44.400 --> 01:35:46.760
What?

01:35:46.840 --> 01:35:50.840
The baby-- it's yours.

01:35:50.960 --> 01:35:54.320
It's ours. I got pregnant
when you were in Malkovich.

01:35:54.400 --> 01:35:57.720
- You cannot fuck
with me anymore, Maxine!
- I'm not!

01:35:59.160 --> 01:36:02.640
I kept it because I knew
you were the father--

01:36:04.360 --> 01:36:06.560
the other mother--
whatever--

01:36:06.600 --> 01:36:09.440
because l--
because it was yours.

01:36:12.040 --> 01:36:13.880
So we're parents?

01:36:15.040 --> 01:36:16.840
Together?

01:36:18.240 --> 01:36:20.120
Yeah.

01:36:38.120 --> 01:36:40.000
Say, uh...

01:36:41.320 --> 01:36:43.840
- aren't you John Malkovich?
- No.

01:36:43.880 --> 01:36:45.800
