01:36:45.880 --> 01:36:48.480
I can't believe
you're in this shithole, man.

01:36:48.520 --> 01:36:51.720
- You guys know this is John Malkovich?
- I'm not John Malkovich.

01:36:51.800 --> 01:36:55.040
- This is John Malkovich.
- I am not John Malkovich!

01:36:59.440 --> 01:37:01.520
[Woman]
Cut it out, you guys.

01:37:01.600 --> 01:37:04.840
[ Panting ]

01:37:11.400 --> 01:37:13.280
- [ Rings ]
- Yes?

01:37:13.320 --> 01:37:16.320
- Lester, please don't do it.
Please don't kill Maxine.
- So you'll leave?

01:37:16.360 --> 01:37:18.800
Yes, I said--
I, uh-- I am leaving.

01:37:18.880 --> 01:37:22.600
All right. Do it now while
I'm on the phone so I can hear...

01:37:22.680 --> 01:37:24.520
and your lovely bride walks.

01:37:24.600 --> 01:37:27.840
Uh-- Okay. Okay.

01:37:27.960 --> 01:37:29.800
I'm going.

01:37:33.760 --> 01:37:36.800
