01:38:12.120 --> 01:38:13.800
I'm free.

01:38:17.480 --> 01:38:20.080
I'm back! I'm--

01:38:20.160 --> 01:38:22.920
[ Grunting ]

01:38:24.960 --> 01:38:27.360
Aaah!

01:38:32.200 --> 01:38:34.200
[ Grunts ]

01:38:35.480 --> 01:38:38.280
Lotte.

01:39:04.920 --> 01:39:06.640
[Door Slams]

01:39:07.800 --> 01:39:09.640
Ooh!

01:39:09.720 --> 01:39:12.400
Eh--

01:39:12.440 --> 01:39:14.360
Hello.
Hello, young lady.

01:39:14.440 --> 01:39:17.880
We're... Malk--

01:39:17.960 --> 01:39:20.680
We're Malkovich.

01:39:20.760 --> 01:39:22.880
- Hey! Hey!
- [Horn Honks]

01:39:22.920 --> 01:39:25.480
Maxine!
I did it, Maxine!

01:39:25.560 --> 01:39:27.520
I left Malkovich for you, sweetie!

01:39:27.560 --> 01:39:29.960
It's no good being Malkovich
without you.

01:39:30.040 --> 01:39:32.120
- It proves I love you!
- [ Lotte ] Fuck off, Craig!

01:39:32.160 --> 01:39:34.680
- Doesn't it?
- [ Maxine ] He's not with us.

01:39:41.040 --> 01:39:43.600
[ Horn Honks ]

01:39:43.640 --> 01:39:46.200
Maxine, I love you!

01:39:46.280 --> 01:39:49.440
I'm gonna go right back into Malkovich,
and I'm gonna kick Lester out!

01:39:49.520 --> 01:39:52.680
And then you'll love me again!
Maxine!

01:39:52.720 --> 01:39:54.600
Maxine!

01:40:00.600 --> 01:40:03.880
[Doorbell Ringing]

01:40:07.080 --> 01:40:11.080
- Ma-Sheen.
- Hey. Malcatraz.

01:40:11.120 --> 01:40:13.320
- Uh, how are you?
- I'm very well. And you?

01:40:13.360 --> 01:40:15.240
- Good, good.
- You look well.

01:40:15.280 --> 01:40:17.160
- Thankyou.
- How's Celeste?

01:40:17.200 --> 01:40:19.720
She's good, yeah.
She's sorry she couldn't make it today.

01:40:19.800 --> 01:40:21.920
- She had to go to the store.
- Oh, that's okay.

01:40:22.000 --> 01:40:24.720
Charlie, hi!
I didn't even hear the door.

01:40:24.800 --> 01:40:28.640
- Lookin' great, Flo.
- I'm looking grateful?

01:40:30.160 --> 01:40:32.920
Charlie, we are not
getting any younger.

01:40:32.960 --> 01:40:35.840
Well, don't rub it in.

01:40:35.880 --> 01:40:38.680
Listen, Charlie,
I know this is going to sound crazy...

01:40:38.760 --> 01:40:42.040
but what would you think
if I told you that I'd found a way...

01:40:42.120 --> 01:40:44.240
for us to live forever?

01:40:44.320 --> 01:40:46.280
All of us.

01:40:46.320 --> 01:40:48.760
-Johnny boy, what are you talking about?
-All of us.

01:40:48.840 --> 01:40:51.800
Celeste, Floris, you, me.
Gary Sinise maybe.

01:40:54.240 --> 01:40:56.600
I don't really understand.

01:41:03.240 --> 01:41:07.760
Charlie, this... is Emily.

01:41:16.960 --> 01:41:18.680
Isn't she lovely?

01:41:18.760 --> 01:41:20.720
[Lotte]
Hey, pass the Cheetos.

01:41:20.800 --> 01:41:23.160
- [Maxine] You need more puffs?
- No, I want more.

01:41:23.240 --> 01:41:26.080
- Okeydoke. They're covered in grease.
- Shut up.

01:41:26.160 --> 01:41:29.880
- Can I swim yet?
- [Maxine]Can you swim yet?

01:41:29.920 --> 01:41:32.600
